@startuml
title Smart Campus - Use-case diagram (revised)
left to right direction

actor Student
actor Administrator

rectangle "Smart Campus Room Booking" {
  usecase "View availability"      as UC1
  usecase "Book room"              as UC2
  usecase "Cancel booking"         as UC3
  usecase "Block or unblock room"  as UC4
  usecase "Review usage"           as UC5
  usecase "Send confirmation"      as UC6

  ' why: R4 and US-04 - confirmation is produced at the end of the successful booking flow only; it is a system outcome, so no actor starts it
  UC2 ..> UC6 : <<include>>
}

Student --> UC1
Student --> UC2
Student --> UC3

Administrator --> UC4
Administrator --> UC5

note right of UC1 : US-01
note right of UC2 : US-02 (R1, R2, R3)
note right of UC3 : US-03 (R2; own bookings only)
note right of UC4 : US-05 (R3)
note right of UC5 : US-06
note right of UC6 : US-04 (R4)

@enduml